WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.193
The king looked in a mirror.

2
00:00:10.194 --> 00:00:15.944
He turned to the side and gasped.

3
00:00:15.945 --> 00:00:20.663
"Sal, come in here!" the king cried.

4
00:00:20.664 --> 00:00:25.242
A servant hurried in.

5
00:00:25.243 --> 00:00:27.739
"Yes, Your Majesty?"

6
00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.057
"There's a hair on my robe," the king said.

7
00:00:32.058 --> 00:00:36.585
"I can't reach it."

8
00:00:36.586 --> 00:00:39.735
The servant picked off the hair.

9
00:00:39.736 --> 00:00:42.954
"Thank you," the king said.

10
00:00:42.955 --> 00:00:45.169
"I'm a king.

11
00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:48.360
I can't have a hair on my robe!"

12
00:00:48.361 --> 00:00:51.645
The king glanced down.

13
00:00:51.646 --> 00:00:55.060
"Sal, your shoe is unbuckled."

14
00:00:55.061 --> 00:00:58.730
Sal quickly buckled the shoe.

15
00:00:58.731 --> 00:01:05.703
"Sorry, Your Majesty."

16
00:01:05.704 --> 00:01:10.909
The king walked into the throne room and sat.

17
00:01:10.910 --> 00:01:14.094
People were waiting to see him.

18
00:01:14.095 --> 00:01:19.288
A servant let in one person at a time.

19
00:01:19.289 --> 00:01:23.109
A woman came in first.

20
00:01:23.110 --> 00:01:28.674
"Your Majesty, I need a job," she said.

21
00:01:28.675 --> 00:01:30.922
"I can sew."

22
00:01:30.923 --> 00:01:37.378
Her hair fell in her face.

23
00:01:37.379 --> 00:01:41.680
The king gave the woman a job.

24
00:01:41.681 --> 00:01:46.558
He also gave her a hair tie.

25
00:01:46.559 --> 00:01:54.286
A man came in next.

26
00:01:54.287 --> 00:01:57.577
His pants looked too big.

27
00:01:57.578 --> 00:02:01.703
"My neighbors are poor," the man said.

28
00:02:01.704 --> 00:02:07.010
"They are old and need food."

29
00:02:07.011 --> 00:02:11.689
"Take some grain for your neighbors," the king said.

30
00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.668
He turned to a servant.

31
00:02:14.669 --> 00:02:28.414
"Get this man a belt!" he shouted.

32
00:02:28.415 --> 00:02:31.429
The king frowned as the man left.

33
00:02:31.430 --> 00:02:36.281
"Everyone looks so messy," he thought.

34
00:02:36.282 --> 00:02:40.660
The door opened again.

35
00:02:40.661 --> 00:02:49.690
A cat in fancy boots walked in!

